{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029040/extras/c2b7970218f80a966994b041f6e12a38.poster.avif?t=1758194873\" width=620 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029040/extras/c2b7970218f80a966994b041f6e12a38.webm?t=1758194873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029040/extras/c2b7970218f80a966994b041f6e12a38.mp4?t=1758194873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aixin: Goddess\u2019 Love is a short visual novel about the intertwined destinies of a goddess and a warrior in a world inspired by ancient Chinese mythology.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Aixin</strong></i> is a young goddess whose purity and virtue seem boundless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wen Yang</strong></i> is a seasoned warrior whose past has left him deeply scarred.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unexpected event becomes a test, forcing both to doubt eternal truths. What is stronger: duty or feeling? Can love atone for sins? And what will remain when all principles collapse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029040/extras/9f6753a08823d9691ed392a0b6c7a336.avif?t=1758194873\" width=1000 height=182 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short story (6800 words).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The demo version covers approximately 1/3 of the game's storyline.</u></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One decisive choice 