d by ancient Chinese mythology.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Aixin</strong></i> is a young goddess whose purity and virtue seem boundless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wen Yang</strong></i> is a seasoned warrior whose past has left him deeply scarred.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unexpected event becomes a test, forcing both to doubt eternal truths. What is stronger: duty or feeling? Can love atone for sins? And what will remain when all principles collapse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029040/extras/9f6753a08823d9691ed392a0b6c7a336.avif?t=1758194873\" width=1000 height=182 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short story (6800 words).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The demo version covers approximately 1/3 of the game's storyline.</u></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One decisive choice that determines the ending. Two alternative endings.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve tried to create a charming audiovisual atmosphere that will highlight the drama of this story.</p></li></ul>","developers":["7th Ascension"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2075510","name":"AIXIN: Goddess' Love"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029040/487e222203379018aa1114b70cce244812c852b7/header.jpg?t=1758194873","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"